<title>JAPAN: Showa Highpolymer - 6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>Showa Highpolymer - 6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to September 30, 1996</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		 15.91		vs	   15.67</p>
<p> Operating	  819    million    vs	  751    million</p>
<p> Current	    850    million    vs	  768    million</p>
<p> Net		  453    million    vs	  473    million</p>
<p> EPS		    8.34 yen	  vs	    9.03 yen</p>
<p> Shares	     54 million	  vs	  52 million</p>
<p> Interim div	  4.00 yen	  vs	    4.00 yen</p>
<p>NOTE - Showa Highpolymer Co Ltd manufactures polyester resin and emulsion-related products.</p>
</text>
